  planner_response {
    modified_response: "I have completed the single-page application for the LODissea project, focusing on a clean, scrolling narrative layout with engaging animations.\n\nHere is an overview of what was implemented:\n- **Hero Opening Section**: Features the paper boat (Sailboat) icon prominently. Uses elegant serif typography for the \"LODissea\" title and the subtitle underneath. \n- **Navigation Integration**: A minimalist, top-right navigation menu that smoothly scrolls the user to the corresponding sub-sections in the About area.\n- **Ocean-Themed About Section**: Built with a deep blue sea background and scroll-triggered animations to elegantly reveal the Project, Team, and Credit disclaimers. \n- **Interactive European Map Journey**: At the bottom, the \"Start the Journey\" action reveals a custom topographic rendering of the European map. The countries (NL, DE, ES, PT, FR, IT) are highlighted, and the paper boat icon dynamically descends onto the map, docking right in the sea coordinates in front of the Netherlands.\n\nThe application is styled using standard Tailwind UI utility classes and Framer Motion for the fluid descent of the paper boat. Let me know if you would like to adjust the coordinates, timing, or typography!"
