  user_input {
    user_response: "Apply the \"Editorial Aesthetic\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Editorial Aesthetic\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML below. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic.\nDesign HTML:                   <!doctype html>\\n                  <html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n                    <head>\\n                      <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n                      <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n                      <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n                      <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n                      <style>\\n                        body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n                        /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n                        .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n                        .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n                        .flex { display: flex; }\\n                        .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n                        .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n                      </style>\\n                    </head>\\n                    <body>\\n                      <div class=\\\"w-[1024px] h-[768px] bg-[#FBF9F5] text-[#1A1A1A] font-serif overflow-hidden flex flex-col relative\\\">\\n  <!-- Header Navigation -->\\n  <nav class=\\\"absolute top-12 right-12 z-20 flex gap-10 font-sans text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-[#8C8279]\\\">\\n    <a href=\\\"#\\\" class=\\\"hover:text-[#1A3A5F] border-b border-transparent hover:border-[#1A3A5F] pb-1 transition-all\\\">Project</a>\\n    <a href=\\\"#\\\" class=\\\"hover:text-[#1A3A5F] border-b border-transparent hover:border-[#1A3A5F] pb-1 transition-all\\\">Team</a>\\n    <a href=\\\"#\\\" class=\\\"hover:text-[#1A3A5F] border-b border-transparent hover:border-[#1A3A5F] pb-1 transition-all\\\">Credit</a>\\n  </nav>\\n\\n  <!-- Main Hero Section -->\\n  <header class=\\\"pt-24 px-20 z-10\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"max-w-2xl\\\">\\n      <h1 class=\\\"text-[110px] leading-[0.85] font-black tracking-tighter mb-4 text-[#1A1A1A]\\\">\\n        LOD<span class=\\\"italic font-light\\\">issea</span>\\n      </h1>\\n      <p class=\\\"font-sans text-[13px] uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-[#5A5A5A] max-w-md leading-relaxed\\\">\\n        A journey through european(a) <br/>cultural heritage database\\n      </p>\\n    </div>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <!-- Stylized European Map Visualization -->\\n  <div class=\\\"absolute top-24 right-[-50px] w-[650px] h-[500px] pointer-events-none opacity-20\\\">\\n    <svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 800 600\\\" class=\\\"w-full h-full fill-current text-[#1A3A5F]\\\">\\n      <!-- Abstract representation of the 6 countries -->\\n      <circle cx=\\\"420\\\" cy=\\\"220\\\" r=\\\"12\\\" /> <!-- NL -->\\n      <circle cx=\\\"460\\\" cy=\\\"280\\\" r=\\\"15\\\" /> <!-- DE -->\\n      <circle cx=\\\"280\\\" cy=\\\"450\\\" r=\\\"18\\\" /> <!-- ES -->\\n      <circle cx=\\\"220\\\" cy=\\\"480\\\" r=\\\"10\\\" /> <!-- PT -->\\n      <circle cx=\\\"350\\\" cy=\\\"350\\\" r=\\\"20\\\" /> <!-- FR -->\\n      <circle cx=\\\"480\\\" cy=\\\"480\\\" r=\\\"14\\\" /> <!-- IT -->\\n      <!-- Connecting dotted lines -->\\n      <path d=\\\"M420 220 Q440 250 460 280\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1\\\" stroke-dasharray=\\\"4\\\" />\\n      <path d=\\\"M460 280 Q405 315 350 350\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1\\\" stroke-dasharray=\\\"4\\\" />\\n      <path d=\\\"M350 350 Q315 400 280 450\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1\\\" stroke-dasharray=\\\"4\\\" />\\n      <path d=\\\"M280 450 L220 480\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1\\\" stroke-dasharray=\\\"4\\\" />\\n      <path d=\\\"M350 350 Q415 415 480 480\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1\\\" stroke-dasharray=\\\"4\\\" />\\n    </svg>\\n    \\n    <!-- Country Labels (Editorial Style) -->\\n    <div class=\\\"absolute top-[210px] left-[440px] text-[10px] font-sans font-bold tracking-widest uppercase\\\">NL</div>\\n    <div class=\\\"absolute top-[275px] left-[485px] text-[10px] font-sans font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-[#1A3A5F]\\\">DE</div>\\n    <div class=\\\"absolute top-[345px] left-[380px] text-[10px] font-sans font-bold tracking-widest uppercase\\\">FR</div>\\n    <div class=\\\"absolute top-[445px] left-[310px] text-[10px] font-sans font-bold tracking-widest uppercase\\\">ES</div>\\n    <div class=\\\"absolute top-[475px] left-[185px] text-[10px] font-sans font-bold tracking-widest uppercase\\\">PT</div>\\n    <div class=\\\"absolute top-[475px] left-[505px] text-[10px] font-sans font-bold tracking-widest uppercase\\\">IT</div>\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <!-- Bottom Section: The Sea -->\\n  <div class=\\\"mt-auto h-[320px] bg-[#1A3A5F] w-full relative p-16 flex flex-col justify-end text-white\\\">\\n    <!-- Wave pattern divider -->\\n    <div class=\\\"absolute top-[-40px] left-0 w-full overflow-hidden leading-none\\\">\\n      <svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 1200 120\\\" preserveAspectRatio=\\\"none\\\" class=\\\"relative block w-full h-[40px] fill-[#1A3A5F]\\\">\\n        <path d=\\\"M0,60 C150,110 350,10 500,60 C650,110 850,10 1000,60 C1150,110 1350,10 1500,60 L1500,120 L0,120 Z\\\"></path>\\n      </svg>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <!-- The Paper Boat (The Icon) -->\\n    <div class=\\\"absolute top-[-60px] left-[150px] w-24 h-24 drop-shadow-2xl transform -rotate-12\\\">\\n      <svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 100 100\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\">\\n        <path d=\\\"M10 65 L50 85 L90 65 L50 55 Z\\\" fill=\\\"white\\\" />\\n        <path d=\\\"M50 20 L50 55 L85 65 Z\\\" fill=\\\"#F0F0F0\\\" />\\n        <path d=\\\"M50 20 L50 55 L15 65 Z\\\" fill=\\\"#D1D1D1\\\" />\\n      </svg>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <div class=\\\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-16 max-w-6xl z-10\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <h3 class=\\\"text-[10px] font-sans font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] mb-4 text-[#7A98B8]\\\">The Project</h3>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-sm leading-relaxed font-light opacity-90\\\">\\n          Tracing the digital legacy of six nations. Through Linked Open Data, we navigate the vast currents of Europeana to discover cultural commonalities.\\n        </p>\\n      </div>\\n      <div>\\n        <h3 class=\\\"text-[10px] font-sans font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] mb-4 text-[#7A98B8]\\\">The Team</h3>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-sm leading-relaxed font-light opacity-90\\\">\\n          An interdisciplinary collective of data scientists and cultural curators dedicated to making heritage data navigable for everyone.\\n        </p>\\n      </div>\\n      <div>\\n        <h3 class=\\\"text-[10px] font-sans font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] mb-4 text-[#7A98B8]\\\">Credit</h3>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-[11px] leading-relaxed font-light opacity-70 italic font-sans\\\">\\n          Data sourced via Europeana API. This project is for educational and research purposes. All digital rights belong to the original contributors.\\n        </p>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <div class=\\\"absolute bottom-8 right-12\\\">\\n        <button class=\\\"bg-white text-[#1A3A5F] px-8 py-3 rounded-full font-sans font-bold text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest hover:bg-[#D1E0ED] transition-colors\\\">\\n            Start the Odyssey\\n        </button>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <!-- Vertical Page Numbers / Status -->\\n  <div class=\\\"absolute left-10 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 flex flex-col gap-4 items-center\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"w-[1px] h-20 bg-gray-300\\\"></div>\\n    <span class=\\\"text-[10px] font-sans font-bold text-[#1A3A5F] rotate-90 my-2\\\">01</span>\\n    <div class=\\\"w-[1px] h-20 bg-gray-300\\\"></div>\\n  </div>\\n</div>\\n                    </body>\\n                  </html>\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
    items {
