eb technologies.\n            </p>\n            <p>\n              Working together to make open data accessible, engaging, and meaningful for everyone navigating the European cultural landscape.\n            </p>\n          </div>\n        </motion.div>\n\n        <motion.div\n          id=\"about-credit\"\n          initial={{ opacity: 0, y: 20 }}\n          whileInView={{ opacity: 1, y: 0 }}\n          viewport={{ once: true, margin: \"-100px\" }}\n          transition={{ duration: 0.8, delay: 0.4 }}\n        >\n          <h2 className=\"text-[10px] font-sans font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] mb-4 text-[#7A98B8]\">Disclaimer & Credits</h2>\n          <p className=\"text-sm font-sans font-light leading-relaxed max-w-2xl opacity-70 italic\">\n            Data sourced from Europeana. All cultural artifacts remain the property of their respective institutions. \n            This project uses Linked Open Data (LOD) principles to connect and display these resources.\n          </p>\n        </motion.div>\n      </div>\n    </section>"
        replacement_content: "    <section className=\"relative min-h-[50vh] bg-[#1A3A5F] text-white p-16 flex flex-col justify-end mt-16 pb-32\">\n      <div className=\"absolute top-[-40px] left-0 w-full overflow-hidden leading-none z-0\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 1200 120\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" className=\"relative block w-full h-[40px] fill-[#1A3A5F]\">\n          <path d=\"M0,60 C150,110 350,10 500,60 C650,110 850,10 1000,60 C1150,110 1350,10 1500,60 L1500,120 L0,120 Z\"></path>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n\n      {/* The Paper Boat (The Icon) positioned above the waves, from the target design */}\n      <div className=\"absolute top-[-60px] left-[150px] w-24 h-24 drop-shadow-2xl transform -rotate-12 hidden md:block\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n          <path d=\"M10 65 L50 85 L90 65 L50 55 Z\" fill=\"white\" />\n          <path d=\"M50 20 L50 55 L85 65 Z\" fill=\"#F0F0F0\" />\n          <path d=\"M50 20 L50 55 L15 65 Z\" fill=\"#D1D1D1\" />\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div className=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-16 max-w-6xl mx-auto z-10 relative\">\n        <motion.div\n          id=\"about-project\"\n          initial={{ opacity: 0, y: 20 }}\n          whileInView={{ opacity: 1, y: 0 }}\n          viewport={{ once: true, margin: \"-100px\" }}\n          transition={{ duration: 0.8 }}\n        >\n          <h3 className=\"text-[10px] font-sans font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] mb-4 text-[#7A98B8]\">The Project</h3>\n          <p className=\"text-sm font-sans leading-relaxed font-light opacity-90\">\n            LODissea maps the cultural connections across Europe, exploring the vast archives of the Europeana database. \n            We navigate through digital artifacts, surfacing hidden narratives and shared histories.\n          </p>\n        </motion.div>\n\n        <motion.div\n          id=\"about-team\"\n          initial={{ opacity: 0, y: 20 }}\n          whileInView={{ opacity: 1, y: 0 }}\n          viewport={{ once: true, margin: \"-100px\" }}\n          transition={{ duration: 0.8, delay: 0.2 }}\n        >\n          <h3 className=\"text-[10px] font-sans font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] mb-4 text-[#7A98B8]\">The Team</h3>\n          <p className=\"text-sm font-sans leading-relaxed font-light opacity-90\">\n            A multidisciplinary group of researchers, designers, and developers passionate about digital cultural heritage and semantic web technologies. Working together to make open data accessible.\n          </p>\n        </motion.div>\n\n        <motion.div\n          id=\"about-credit\"\n          initial={{ opacity: 0, y: 20 }}\n          whileInView={{ opacity: 1, y: 0 }}\n          viewport={{ once: true, margin: \"-100px\" }}\n          transition={{ duration: 0.8, delay: 0.4 }}\n        >\n          <h3 className=\"text-[10px] font-sans font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] mb-4 text-[#7A98B8]\">Credit</h3>\n          <p className=\"text-[11px] font-sans leading-relaxed font-light opacity-70 italic\">\n            Data sourced from Europeana. All cultural artifacts remain the property of their respective institutions. \n            This project uses Linked Open Data (LOD) principles to connect and display these resources.\n          </p>\n        </motion.div>\n      </div>\n    </section>"
      }
      num_matches: 1
    }
  }
